{"t":"Shallow Water","s":"shallow-water-d7d80","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_769177.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Shallow Water</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Shallow Water\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_769177.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flooring<br/>Natural Tiles</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #336699; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">January 07, 1997<br/>Alpha 1.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150601092611&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_769177.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  shallow water.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>All around the land of <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a>, rivers and water falls.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can fish from a pool of shallow water, and in some areas, swim in it too. Boots of Waterwalking exist, but their use is unknown. You can fill a water container eg. Trough, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">Bucket</a> or Bottle with water by using it with an above ground Shallow Water tile.\n</p><p>There are also other variations:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shallow Water Tile (630)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_Tile_630_eef747.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shallow Water Tile (631)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_Tile_631_1ec7ed.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shallow Water Tile (632)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_Tile_632_e538ec.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shallow Water Tile (633)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_Tile_633_2567dd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shallow Water Tile (634)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shallow_Water_Tile_634_d1e934.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p><p>As well as <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Tile%29\">underground version of water</a>:\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Water (Tile)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Water_Tile_ebbd95.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Boots of Waterwalking</li><li>Bottle</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">Bucket</a></li><li>Fishing</li><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/oramond-quest\">Oramond Quest</a></li><li>Tiles</li><li>Trough</li><li>Water</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Tile%29\">Water (Tile)</a></li><li>Wave</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":[